  "scope": "Use Photocraft-aligned rfd for native vault folder selection; prepare the legacy-compatible private per-vault app-data directory and scan the selected vault through VaultSession on a Rayon worker.",
  "behavior": [
    "The desktop boundary supplies a native folder-picker callback to the egui shell; the UI crate does not depend on rfd or platform APIs.",
    "Cancelling the picker leaves the current session intact. A failed replacement open also preserves the current session and shows a safe, path-free error.",
    "Per-vault access-control setup and Markdown scanning run on Rayon; an mpsc receiver returns the result while egui requests bounded repaint intervals.",
    "The UI shows the selected vault's folder name and Markdown count without displaying the absolute path."
  ],
